{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-1","title":"John 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ teaches Nicodemus the necessity of regeneration, 14 of faith in his death, 16 the great love of God towards the world, 18 and the condemnation for unbelief. 22 Jesus baptizes in Judea. 23 The baptism, witness, and doctrine of John concerning Christ.</p>\n<p>10; 7:47-49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-2","title":"John 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>came. 7:50,51; 12:42,43; 19:38,39; Jud 6:27; Isa 51:7; Php 1:14 Rabbi. 26; 1:38; 20:16 we know. Mt 22:16; Mr 12:14 for. 5:36; 7:31; 9:16,30-33; 11:47,48; 12:37; 15:24; Ac 2:22; 4:16,17 Ac 10:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-3","title":"John 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Verily. 1:51; Mt 5:18; 2Co 1:19,20; Re 3:14 Except. 5,6; 1:13; Ga 6:15; Eph 2:1; Tit 3:5; Jas 1:18; 1Pe 1:3,23-25 1Jo 2:29; 3:9; 5:1,18 again. or, from above. Jas 1:17; 3:17 he cannot. 5; 1:5; 12:40; De 29:4; Jer 5:21; Mt 13:11-16; 16:17; 2Co 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-4","title":"John 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>How. 3; 4:11,12; 6:53,60; 1Co 1:18; 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-5","title":"John 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>born. 3; Isa 44:3,4; Eze 36:25-27; Mt 3:11; Mr 16:16; Ac 2:38; Eph 5:26 Tit 3:4-7; 1Pe 1:2; 3:21; 1Jo 5:6-8 and of. 1:13; Ro 8:2; 1Co 2:12; 6:11; 1Jo 2:29; 5:1,6-8 cannot. Mt 5:20; 18:3; 28:19; Lu 13:3,5,24; Ac 2:38; 3:19; Ro 14:17 2Co 5:17,18; Ga 6:15; Eph 2:4-10; 2Th 2:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-6","title":"John 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>born of the flesh. Ge 5:3; 6:5,12; Job 14:4; 15:14-16; 25:4; Ps 51:10; Ro 7:5,18,25 Ro 8:1,4,5-9,13; 1Co 15:47-49; 2Co 5:17; Ga 5:16-21,24; Eph 2:3 Col 2:11 that. Eze 11:19,20; 36:26,27; Ro 8:5,9; 1Co 6:17; Ga 5:17; 1Jo 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-7","title":"John 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Marvel. 12; 5:28; 6:61-63 Ye. 3; Job 15:14; Mt 13:33-35; Ro 3:9-19; 9:22-25; 12:1,2; Eph 4:22-24 Col 1:12; Heb 12:14; 1Pe 1:14-16,22; Re 21:27 again. or, from above.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-8","title":"John 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>wind. Job 37:10-13,16,17,21-23; Ps 107:25,29; Ec 11:4,5; Eze 37:9 Ac 2:2; 4:31; 1Co 2:11; 12:11 so. 1:13; Isa 55:9-13; Mr 4:26-29; Lu 6:43,44; 1Co 2:11; 1Jo 2:29; 3:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-9","title":"John 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>How. 4; 6:52,60; Pr 4:18; Isa 42:16; Mr 8:24,25; Lu 1:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-10","title":"John 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Art. Isa 9:16; 29:10-12; 56:10; Jer 8:8,9; Mt 11:25; 15:14; 22:29 and knowest. De 10:16; 30:6; 1Ch 29:19; Ps 51:6,10; 73:1; Isa 11:6-9; 66:7-9 Jer 31:33; 32:39,40; Eze 11:19; 18:31,32; 36:25-27; 37:23,24 Ro 2:28; Php 3:3; Col 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-11","title":"John 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>verily. 3,5 We speak. 13,32-34; 1:18; 7:16; 8:14,28,29,38; 12:49; 14:24; Isa 55:4; Mt 11:27 Lu 10:22; 1Jo 1:1-3; 5:6-12; Re 1:5; 3: