ey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>near. Ge 33:18 Shalem. 1Sa 9:4 Shalim. much. Jer 51:13; Eze 19:10; 43:2; Re 1:15; 14:2; 19:6 and they. Mt 3:5,6; Mr 1:4,5; Lu 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-24","title":"John 3:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Mt 4:12; 14:3; Mr 6:17; Lu 3:19,20; 9:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-25","title":"John 3:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>about. 2:6; Mt 3:11; Mr 7:2-5,8; Heb 6:2; 9:10,13,14,23; 1Pe 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-26","title":"John 3:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>he that. Nu 11:26-29; Ec 4:4; 1Co 3:3-5; Ga 5:20,21; 6:12,13; Jas 3:14-18 Jas 4:5,6 to whom. 1:7,15,26-36 and all. 1:7,9; 11:48; 12:19; Ps 65:2; Isa 45:23; Ac 19:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-27","title":"John 3:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>A man. Nu 16:9-11; 17:5; 1Ch 28:4,5; Jer 1:5; 17:16; Am 7:15; Mt 25:15 Mr 13:34; Ro 1:5; 12:6; 1Co 1:1; 2:12-14; 3:5; 4:7; 12:11; 15:10 Ga 1:1; Eph 1:1; 3:7,8; 1Ti 2:7; Jas 1:17; 1Pe 4:10,11 receive. or, take unto himself. Heb 5:4,5 from. Mt 21:25; Mr 11:30,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-28","title":"John 3:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>I said. 1:20,25,27 but. 1:23; Mal 3:1; 4:4,5; Mt 3:3,11,12; Mr 1:2,3; Lu 1:16,17,76; 3:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-3-29","title":"John 3:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>hath. Ps 45:9-17; So 3:11; 4